      "section_title": "3.1 工业网络安全简介",
      "block_type": "paragraph",
      "text": "工业网络安全整合了所有用于保护工业控制系统（ICS）和运营技术（OT）环境的措施，其\n核心目标是保障以下三个关键方面：",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.193,
        171.906,
        448.697,
        196.359
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-32D86711ED1302DA",
      "document_id": "DOC-DF116E7199E2",
      "source_sha256": "e8c23ac43317f1ca9092017ee420c2f9dd29b3734e10a2247f0e7992014a83bc",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 8,
      "printed_page_label": "4",
      "block_order": 3,
      "section_id": "SEC-0CC5AC54DAF3522F",
      "section_path": [
        "3 工业网络安全",
        "3.1 工业网络安全简介"
      ],
      "section_title": "3.1 工业网络安全简介",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n可用性：确保系统、网络和数据在需要时可被授权用户访问和使用，防止因破坏、故障或\n拒绝服务攻击(DoS) 导致的业务中断。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.193,
        205.484,
        453.368,
        231.359
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
